{"3863340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ramona", "steam_appid": 3863340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4049020], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/5fe734702986782788ee61ac485f65ac.avif?t=1761919222\" width=600 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona is a first-person psychological horror set in the 1970s. A claustrophobic journey between light and darkness, truth and hallucination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/e27c0c535245c172d5927da8fa3a242a.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samuel</strong> is a young journalist tasked with interviewing Ramona, a mysterious former babysitter involved in a tragic crime story. But once he enters her apartment, he discovers that Ramona has vanished... or perhaps she never truly left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/aca7d91b50c60c43154740c21975d0e6.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/f6705e282df884b7ec563d90fd0652a0.webp?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through an old camera and a series of rules to follow, Samuel delves into a house that is alive, restless, haunted by <strong>remorse and buried memories</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/af29f131dc6a6fd6d8b0eb28e6b43a6b.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photographs in the dark to reveal what the human eye cannot see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/be48b0032e07113318799df7527d2a68.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not turn on radios, do not move objects, do not break the rules. Or Ramona will awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/7b24d802c5fee82646a60319023edd0c.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and collect documents to uncover the truth about Ramona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/e53da7313e00d76bddccb96b15dec146.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has a story. Every photograph hides a secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona is an intense narrative experience, where every choice, every noise, and every silence can change your fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/7443813feadc9f639cd3105dc701d6cb.webp?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 A camera as your only weapon against the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 A system of rules to follow in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Environmental storytelling through letters, diaries, and photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Unique puzzles integrated into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Original soundtrack inspired by the 1970s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ramona is not just any ghost. She is the reflection of your guilt. It’s up to you to decide whether to face it… or run away once again.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/5fe734702986782788ee61ac485f65ac.avif?t=1761919222\" width=600 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona is a first-person psychological horror set in the 1970s. A claustrophobic journey between light and darkness, truth and hallucination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/e27c0c535245c172d5927da8fa3a242a.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samuel</strong> is a young journalist tasked with interviewing Ramona, a mysterious former babysitter involved in a tragic crime story. But once he enters her apartment, he discovers that Ramona has vanished... or perhaps she never truly left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/aca7d91b50c60c43154740c21975d0e6.avif?t=1761919222\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b